<title>USA: Port Huron ASD, Mich., won by Harris.</title>
<headline>Port Huron ASD, Mich., won by Harris.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bk., said it won $7.985 million of Port Huron ASD, Mich., general obligation 1997 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
